          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "52A8DC6EF1BB7178",
      "text": "嗯呵呵，莉普我的騎士\\n真是可靠呀。\\r\\n但這只是開個玩笑而已，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳放心吧。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
