      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "FC4318675651BB3B",
      "text": "話說，[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n記得莉普我的工作是什麼嗎？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
