    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02c",
      "hash64": "F7C0B797ACE36397",
      "text": "完美的答案！\\n莉普我是個彩妝藝術家！\\c\\n雖說還兼任模特兒和\\n道館館主就是了。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "FC431A675651BEA1",
      "text": "這邊有很多人不認識莉普我，\\n在告訴他們莉普我的工作之後，\\r\\n大家都非～常感興趣。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "FC431B675651C054",
      "text": "莉普我在帕底亞算是個知名人士，\\n但在海外也只是個普通人呢。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "FC431C675651C207",
      "text": "既然如此，我可要趁這個機會讓全世界\\n完美知道莉普我的美麗秘訣才行！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
