    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "68EDCCBDB199640C",
      "text": "雖然這種假裝糊塗的角色也很可愛……\\n但僅限現在這樣喔？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
