    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "EDF6101629A1CCBA",
      "text": "一直維持同樣的姿勢不變\\n可是很不好的。\\c\\n這種時候該怎麼辦呢？\\n嗯呵！當然是做喜怒驚樂體操。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
