    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "EDF60A1629A1C288",
      "text": "莉普我的飄飄雛\\n狀況怎麼樣呢？\\c\\n是不是一塊霹靂又強大，\\n讓人大吃一驚的好料子呀！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
